<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PFF Bancorp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PFF Bancorp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said analyst John Kline cut PFF Bancorp Inc to hold rating from a buy, based on price appreciation of the stock.</p>
<p>-- revised 12 to 18 month price target to $18 from $17.</p>
<p>-- PFF shares closed at 16-15/16 on Friday.</p>
</text>
